cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
title: "Predictive Digital Twin for 5G RRC Storm Mitigation"
abstract: >-
  A Python/SimPy simulation of a calibrated predictive Digital Twin that
  mitigates botnet-driven 5G RRC signaling storms. The repository implements a
  five-phase MMPP/M/c/K queueing pipeline comparing no mitigation, reactive
  Access Class Barring, an uncalibrated predictive Digital Twin, and a
  continuously calibrated Digital Twin evaluated with multi-seed confidence
  intervals.
